OL,3,GNEWSAMother and daughter complete
OL,4,A'amazing milestone' by running Belfast
OL,5,AHalf Marathon
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Lisburn woman who finished the
OL,8,FBelfast Half Marathon alongside her
OL,9,Fdaughter, who has autism and additional
OL,10,Fneeds said it was an "emotional day" as
OL,11,Fthey completed an "amazing" milestone
OL,12,Ftogether.
OL,14,FMartina Rydout's daughter Anita is 25.
OL,15,FAt the age of four she was diagnosed
OL,16,Fwith severe global developmental delay
OL,17,Fand her family said the initial
OL,18,Fprognosis for her future was bleak.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
