OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMother and daughter complete
OL,4,A'amazing milestone' by running Belfast
OL,5,AHalf Marathon
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Sunday, along with her mum and a
OL,8,Fnumber of friends, she completed the
OL,9,Fhalf marathon, after Anita took up
OL,10,Frunning a decade ago with this goal in
OL,11,Fmind.
OL,13,FThe 13.1 mile race started and finished
OL,14,Fin Ormeau Embankment as thousands of
OL,15,Frunners took in the north, south, east,
OL,16,Fand west of the city along their route.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
